@host=http://127.0.0.1:8080/scim/v2
@jwt=REPLACE_WITH_KEYCLOAK_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 1. Initial realm export via SCIM 2.0 Bulk (Users + Groups with externalId and bulkId)
POST {{host}}/Bulk HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json
X-Request-Id: keycloak-realm-sync-01

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:BulkRequest"],
  "failOnErrors": 1,
  "Operations": [
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/Users",
      "bulkId": "kc-user-1",
      "data": {
        "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:User"],
        "externalId": "b8c4e190-51df-4b77-949b-7126e373a001",
        "userName": "jdoe",
        "displayName": "John Doe",
        "active": true,
        "emails": [
          { "value": "jdoe@corp.internal", "type": "work", "primary": true }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/Groups",
      "bulkId": "kc-group-1",
      "data": {
        "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:Group"],
        "externalId": "f19d7c22-88aa-4c13-b12e-990011223344",
        "displayName": "realm-admins",
        "members": [
          { "value": "bulkId:kc-user-1", "type": "User", "display": "John Doe" }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Reconcile user by Keycloak UUID (externalId)
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=externalId%20eq%20%22b8c4e190-51df-4b77-949b-7126e373a001%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 3. Reconcile user by core URN-prefixed userName
GET {{host}}/Users?filter=urn:ietf:params:scim:schemas:core:2.0:User:userName%20eq%20%22jdoe%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 4. Query groups containing a user via dotted multi-valued path
@userId=REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID
GET {{host}}/Groups?filter=members.value%20eq%20%22{{userId}}%22 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Accept: application/scim+json

### 5. Optimistic concurrency update with ETag / If-Match
@etag=W/"REPLACE_WITH_VERSION"
PATCH {{host}}/Users/{{userId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:PatchOp"],
  "Operations": [
    { "op": "replace", "path": "title", "value": "Platform Engineer" }
  ]
}

### 6. Server-root POST /.search
POST {{host}}/.search HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/scim+json

{
  "schemas": ["urn:ietf:params:scim:api:messages:2.0:SearchRequest"],
  "filter": "externalId eq \"b8c4e190-51df-4b77-949b-7126e373a001\"",
  "attributes": ["userName", "externalId", "groups"]
}
